    <section>
      <title>Bootstrap Extension components</title>
      <p>The <xref href="html/bootstrap-extension.dita">Bootstrap Extension</xref> specialization adds elements for
        Bootstrap Extension features. Topics that use them must declare the extension DTD instead:</p>
      <codeblock
        outputclass="language-xml"
      >&lt;!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//DITA Bootstrap//DTD DITA Bootstrap Extension Topic//EN" "bootstrap-ext-topic.dtd"&gt;</codeblock>
      <table>
        <tgroup cols="3">
          <colspec colname="c1" colwidth="1*"/>
          <colspec colname="c2" colwidth="2*"/>
          <colspec colname="c3" colwidth="1*"/>
          <thead>
            <row>
              <entry>Component</entry>
              <entry>Elements</entry>
              <entry>Extends</entry>
            </row>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <row>
              <entry>Counter</entry>
              <entry><xmlelement>counter</xmlelement></entry>
              <entry><xmlelement>ph</xmlelement></entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>Parallax</entry>
              <entry><xmlelement>parallax</xmlelement></entry>
              <entry><xmlelement>section</xmlelement></entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>Slider</entry>
              <entry><xmlelement>slider</xmlelement></entry>
              <entry><xmlelement>bodydiv</xmlelement></entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>Whitebox</entry>
              <entry><xmlelement>whitebox</xmlelement>, <xmlelement>whitebox-item</xmlelement></entry>
              <entry><xmlelement>ul</xmlelement>, <xmlelement>li</xmlelement></entry>
            </row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </table>
    </section>
    <section>
      <title>Colors and borders</title>
      <p>Most specializations, and many base DITA elements, support common attributes to control their
        appearance:</p>
      <dl>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Color themes</dt>
          <dd>Standard Bootstrap themes: <option>primary</option>, <option>secondary</option>, <option
            >success</option>, <option>danger</option>, <option>warning</option>, <option>info</option>, <option
            >light</option> and <option>dark</option>.</dd>
        </dlentry>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Border thickness</dt>
          <dd>Numeric values from <option>1</option> to <option>5</option> control the border width.</dd>
        </dlentry>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Rounded corners</dt>
          <dd>Values such as <option>yes</option>, <option>no</option>, <option>pill</option> or <option
            >circle</option>.</dd>
        </dlentry>
      </dl>
    </section>
  </body>
</topic>
